OL,3,GNEWSAButlin's check-out times 'could
OL,4,Aease train crowds'
OL,5,
OL,6,FButlin's could be asked to stagger
OL,7,Fcheck-out times at its Skegness resort
OL,8,Fto help ease overcrowding on trains
OL,9,Fleaving the town.
OL,11,FIt comes after passengers travelling to
OL,12,Fthe town on East Midlands Railway (EMR)
OL,13,Ftrains this summer complained of
OL,14,Fovercrowding in 30C heat.
OL,16,FEMR said approaching Butlin's was one
OL,17,Fof the options being considered, but
OL,18,Fthe holiday park declined to comment.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
